<title>GABON: Gabon cancels Sunday's general elections - TV.</title>
<headline>Gabon cancels Sunday's general elections - TV.</headline>
<dateline>LIBREVILLE 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gabon has postponed indefinitely general elections due to be held in the Central African country on Sunday, the government said on Saturday.</p>
<p>National Elections Commission president Nguema Essono, in a television news announcement, cited organisational difficulties stemming from chaotic local elections in October.</p>
